/* The Insights collection. Rewritten 26 October 2026 to read like a good
   long-form blog rather than a policy memo (user: "should feel like written
   in medium and other big blog posts. sound human, authentic and organic"):
   an opening scene, plain sentences of mixed length, a point of view, one
   pull quote and a closing note the reader can take into a meeting.

   Rules that did not change: research claims are linked inline and stated
   no further than the source supports; scenes are illustrative, never
   presented as client events; bylines name a team, never an executive or an
   invented person; agents are in preview and never act or write back on
   their own; no em dashes; British spelling. Existing URLs are kept.

   DRAFT: the publication dates below are staggered weekly for the hi-fi
   mockup. Set the real dates at publication. */

